zlib-ng for Debian
------------------

This project includes a compatibility mode for zlib, and upstream considers
API and ABI issues bugs to be fixed. But this needs coordination on how to
provide that support alongside or instead of zlib. Once that is clear this
can be reconsidered.

 -- Guillem Jover <guillem@debian.org>  Tue, 24 Sep 2024 19:26:18 +0200
